<title>USA: Patriot completes 1.927-for-1 stk split.</title>
<headline>Patriot completes 1.927-for-1 stk split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc said Monday that it has completed a 1.927-for-one stock split in the form of a stock divided.</p>
<p>Patriot American's shares are traded with those of Patriot American Hospitality Operating Company as a single unit.</p>
<p>Patriot American  is a hotel real estate investment trust with 64 hotels and resorts in tis portfolio.</p>
</text>
